{"id":"gamefreak-director-192","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"[GameFreak部长专栏] 第192回","display_title":"【开发日记】2011年初访韩国，出席《宝可梦 黑·白》韩国版发售活动","dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一 2011 年 4 月第一次到韩国，出席韩国版《宝可梦 黑·白》发售活动：宝可梦韩国办公室、签名会，以及明洞街头写着“我们是你们的朋友”的声援旗帜。","date":"2011-04-27","publication":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第192回","source":{"title":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第192回","url":"https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/04/index.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/04/index.html","type":"official_blog"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 黑·白","slug":"black-white"}],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","宝可梦","官方博客","ポケモン","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","翻译资料"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":2339,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/entry-192/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192a.jpg","cover_kind":"own","size":null,"lore":{"facets":{"pokemon":[{"name":"莱希拉姆","ndex":643,"seg":[88],"as":["Reshiram"],"via":"body"},{"name":"捷克罗姆","ndex":644,"seg":[88],"as":["Zekrom"],"via":"body"}],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 黑·白","slug":"black-white","seg":[],"via":"entities"}],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi","role":"mentioned","seg":[]}],"places":[{"name":"羽田","id":null,"entity":null,"category":null,"world":"real","scale":"spot","seg":[47],"what":"出发机场","via":"llm"},{"name":"金浦机场","id":null,"entity":null,"category":null,"world":"real","scale":"spot","seg":[48],"what":"抵达机场","via":"llm"},{"name":"宝可梦韩国办公室","id":null,"entity":null,"category":null,"world":"real","scale":"spot","seg":[60],"what":"宝可梦公司办公室","via":"llm"},{"name":"明洞","id":null,"entity":null,"category":null,"world":"real","scale":"spot","seg":[99],"what":"活动后到访地","via":"llm"}],"concepts":[]},"observations":[{"seg":43,"text":"韩语版《宝可梦 黑·白》于4月21日发售"},{"seg":76,"text":"有人从早上8点半开始排队等候"}],"relations":[],"sources":{"pokemon_names":"2026-09-23","tour_places":"2026-09-23","model":"deepseek-chat","relations_model":"deepseek-chat","concepts":"2026-09-26"},"built":"2026-09-25","edited":false,"by_seg":{"88":{"dex":[643,644]},"47":{"places":["羽田"]},"48":{"places":["金浦机场"]},"60":{"places":["宝可梦韩国办公室"]},"99":{"places":["明洞"]},"43":{"obs":0},"76":{"obs":1}}},"archive_type":"gamefreak_director_column","summary":"增田顺一 2011 年 4 月第一次到韩国，出席韩国版《宝可梦 黑·白》发售活动：宝可梦韩国办公室、签名会，以及明洞街头写着“我们是你们的朋友”的声援旗帜。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"deepseek-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"你好。\n\n4月21日，韩国版《宝可梦 黑·白》发售了。\n\n为了出席那场活动，我第一次踏上了我一直想去的韩国！！\n\n从东京羽田，飞往韩国金浦机场。\n\n一路驱车飞奔，直奔市中心。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n途中，经过了好几座美丽的桥。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n和东京别无二致的高楼群。\n\n说到韩国，那就是好吃的料理！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n先填饱肚子。于是，我吃了活章鱼！！它还在动。。不过。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n螃蟹也吃了。虽然辣，但非常好吃。\n\n接着，前往宝可梦韩国的办公室。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n员工们正干劲十足地工作着！\n\n上到楼顶，竟有这样绝佳的景色。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n摆在那里、让我有点在意的灭火器。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n又粗又敦实，很可爱。\n\n然后，前往酒店。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n从酒店望出去的景色也很棒。高楼大厦真帅。\n\n接着，发售日21日一大早。前往活动会场。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n时间是早上9点。\n\n排队参加签名会的人们，据说从8点30分左右就开始排了。\n\n天这么冷，谢谢你们！！\n\n真的来了好多人！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/oma.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n我超级开心啊！！！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n初始三只宝可梦的玩偶装登场！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n首先，是打招呼。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/omb.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n当当——！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n莱希拉姆和捷克罗姆。中间的桌子就是增田举办签名会的座位。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/omc.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n签名中。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n韩文由元音、辅音、元音构成，据说记住之后马上就能读。\n\n(마=ma, 스=su, 다=da)\n\n增田的韩文初体验，就是写下一位女粉丝的名字！\n\n韩国的宝可梦粉丝们非常亲切，热情地迎接了我。\n\n也谢谢你们送来的许多信件和画作！！\n\n我从大家那里得到了许多创作好作品的能量！！\n\n今后我也会继续努力！\n\n活动结束后，我去明洞，看到了这样的旗帜。\n\n“日本的各位，请不要放弃。请加油。\n\n　我们是你们的朋友。”\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n我非常感动。\n\n韩国的各位，谢谢你们！\n\n谢谢！\n\n再见！\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n<details class=\"gf-director-language\"><summary>查看官方英文版</summary>\n\nAnnyongHaseyo!\n\nOn April 21st, Korean version of Pokemon Black and White\n\nhave launched.\n\nI visited Korea for the launch event.\n\nKorea is the country I always wanted to go!!\n\nLeaving Haneda(Tokyo), and\n\narriving at Gimpo airport(Korea).\n\nHeading to the center of the city by car.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nOn the way to the city,\n\nthere are many beautiful bridges.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nSkyscrapers, same as Tokyo.\n\nSpeaking of Korea, delicious meals!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nLet’s eat something. I ate live octopus!! It was moving…\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nI ate crabs, too. It was spicy, but somewhat tasty.\n\nAnd Pokemon Korea office.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nMany staffs were working!\n\nBeautiful sight from the rooftop.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nLittle fire extinguisher got my attention.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nFat and cute. Bottlish…\n\nHeading to the hotel.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nView from the hotel was fantastic.\n\nCool skyscrapers.\n\nAnd the morning of launch day, 21st.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nTime is nine o’clock in the morning.\n\nSome people start waiting from 8:30 in the morning.\n\nIt was cold morning, but thank you for coming!!\n\nMany people visited to this event!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/oma.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nI’m just so happy!!!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nLife size dolls of first three Pokemon!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nFirst, self introduction.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/omb.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nTa-da—!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nReshiram, Zekrom and the chair I used for the signing autographs.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/omc.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nSigning autographs.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nHangul is coordinated by vowels and consonants.\n\nIf you learn Hangul, you soon be able to learn it.\n\nThis is my first time to write in Hangul, the name of girl fan.\n\nAll of Korea Pokemon fans are nice and warm.\n\nThank you very much for the letter and drawings.\n\nI’ve received a lot of energy from many people.\n\nI’ll work as hard as I could.\n\nAfter the event, I visited Myungdong and found a banner.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/en/192o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nIt says “People in Japan, please don’t give up. Hang on.\n\nWe are friend of yours.”\n\nI’m extremely moved.\n\nPeople of Korea, Thank you very much!\n\nKamsaHamnida!\n\nCiao!\n\n\n</details>","markdown_ja":"（原文是日文与韩文对照的文字图片，以下为转写；文字原图附在本栏末尾。）\n\nアンニョンハセヨ。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">안녕하세요.</p>\n\n4月21日、韓国版ポケモンブラック・ホワイトが発売されました。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">4월21일, 한국판 포켓몬 블랙·화이트가 시판되었습니다.</p>\n\nそのイベントに出席するため、ずっと行きたかった韓国へ初上陸！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">그 이벤트에 출석하기 위해, 그동안 쭉 가고 싶었던 한국에 첫 상륙!!</p>\n\n東京羽田から、韓国金浦空港へ。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">도쿄(東京) 하네다(羽田)로부터, 한국 김포공항(金浦空港)으로.</p>\n\nひたすら車を飛ばして中心街へ。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">한결같이 차를 몰아 중심가로.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n途中、いくつもの美しい橋が。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">도중, 몇몇의 아름다운 다리가 계속되고.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n東京と変わらぬ、高層ビル群。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">도쿄(東京)와 다를 바 없는 고층빌딩 군.</p>\n\n韓国と言えば、美味しい料理！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">한국이라고 하면, 맛있는 요리!!</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nまずは腹ごしらえ。ということで、活きたタコを食べましたよ！！うごいてます。。けど。。。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">우선은 배를 채우자싶어, 산낙지를 먹었습니다!! 살아... 움직이고... 있지만..</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n蟹も食べました。辛いけどすごく美味しい。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">게장도 먹었습니다. 매웠지만 굉장히 맛있더군요.</p>\n\nそして、ポケモンコリアのオフィスへ。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">그리고, 포켓몬 코리아의 오피스로.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nスタッフがバリバリ働いていました！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">스탭들이 열심히 일하고더군요!</p>\n\n屋上に上がるとこんな素晴らしい景色が。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">옥상에 올라가니 이런 훌륭한 경치가.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n置いてあってちょっと気になった消火器。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">바닥에 놓여있던 약간 눈이 가는 소화기.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n太くてぼてっとしていて可愛いです。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">굵고 통통한것이 귀엽더군요.</p>\n\nそして、ホテルへ。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">그리고, 호텔로.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nホテルからの景色も素晴らしいです。高層ビルが格好いい。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">호텔에서의 경치도 훌륭합니다. 고층빌딩이 멋져요.</p>\n\nそして、発売日の21日早朝。イベント会場へ。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">그리고, 발매일인 21일 이른 아침. 이벤트 회장으로.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n時間は、朝9時。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">시간은, 아침 9시.</p>\n\nサイン会に並んでくれた方々は8時30分頃から並んでくださっていたとか。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">사인회에 줄서주신 분들은 8시30분경부터 서 주셨다던데.</p>\n\n寒い中、ありがとう！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">추웠을텐데, 고마워요!!</p>\n\n本当にたくさんの人たちが来てくれました！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">정말로 많은 분들이 와 주셨습니다!!</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/oma.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n超嬉しいんですけど！！！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">정말로 기쁘더군요 !!!!</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n最初の3匹の着ぐるみ登場！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">처음의 3마리의 인형 복장이 등장!!</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nまずは、ご挨拶。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">먼저 인사부터.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/omb.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nばばーーーん！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">짜잔~~~~~~~~~~┐</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nレシラムとゼクロム。真ん中の机がマスダがサイン会をした席。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">【레시라무】와 【제쿠로무】. 한복판의 책상은 마스다가 사인회를 한 자리.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/omc.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nサイン中。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">싸인 중.</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nハングルは母音、子音、母音で構成されていて覚えるとすぐ読めるらしいです。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">한글은 모음, 자음, 모음으로 구성되어 있어서 배우면 바로 읽을 수 있는 모양입니다.</p>\n\n(마=ma, 스=su, 다=da)\n\nマスダはファンの女性の名前を書いたのが、ハングルデビューでした！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">마스다는 팬 여성분의 이름을 쓴 것이, 한글 데뷔였습니다!</p>\n\n韓国のポケモンファンの人たちは、すごく親切で温かく迎えてくれました。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">한국의 포켓몬 팬들은, 굉장히 친절하고 따뜻하게 맞이해 주었습니다.</p>\n\nたくさんの手紙や絵もありがとう！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">많은 편지와 그림도 고마웠어요!!</p>\n\nみなさんから良い作品を創るエネルギーを沢山貰いました！！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">여러분들로부터 좋은 작품을 만들 에너지를 많이 받았습니다!!</p>\n\nこれらかも頑張ります！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">앞으로도 힘내겠습니다!</p>\n\nイベント終了後、明洞に行くと、こんな旗が。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">이벤트 종료후, 명동(明洞)에 가니, 이런 깃발이.</p>\n\n「日本の皆様あきらめないでください。頑張ってください。\n\n私たちはあなたたちの友だちです。」\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">「일본의 여러분 포기하지 말아 주세요. 힘내세요.</p>\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">우리들은 당신들의 친구입니다.」</p>\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/192o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nとても感動しました。\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">매우 감동했습니다.</p>\n\n韓国のみなさま、ありがとうございました！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">한국의 여러분, 고마웠습니다!</p>\n\nカムサハムニダ！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">감사합니다!</p>\n\nチャオ！\n\n<p lang=\"ko\">챠오!</p>\n\n<details><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx01.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx02.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx03.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx04.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx05.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx06.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx07.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx08.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx09.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx10.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx11.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx12.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx13.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx14.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx15.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx16.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx171.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx18.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx19.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx20.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx21.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx22.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx232.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx24.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx25.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx26.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx27.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx28.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx29.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx30.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/192/ja/tx31.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">"}}